{
  "description": "Cross-implementation params_hash vectors (onemind-xr docs/contracts/asset-command.md section 5): params_hash = \"sha256:\" + lowercase hex SHA-256 of the RFC 8785 (JCS) form of {action_type, action_version, target: {entity_type, entity_id}, params}. params_json is the parameter object exactly as received on the wire (empty means {}); canonical is the JCS text that is hashed. A command's approval.params_hash is the hash of the approved action: asset.{verb} over the command data when the command has no task_id, task.assign or task.abort over the task parameters when it has one. Generated from omos services/policy ParamsHash (PR #554) and checked by services/policy, services/bridge/bridges/mavlink (PR #550) and services/bridge/bridges/ros2 (PR #566). Do not edit one copy: every branch carries the same file.",
